<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50761" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĕternus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		vetus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of great age</i>, <i>old</i>, <i>ancient</i> (only post-class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rupes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Fulg. Myth. 1 praef.</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">silentia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Cath. 9, 68</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĕter-nus</span></b> , i, m.
			* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Old age</i>, <i>age</i>, <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 6,
				94</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Old dirt</i> (post-Aug. and very rare), <i><span class="en">Col. 4, 24,
				6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">App. M. 9, p.
			223</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Lethargy</i>, <i>somnolence</i> (as a
			disease of aged people). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">num eum veternus aut aqua intercus tenet?</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Men. 5, 4, 3</span></i>
			.—<i>Of the deep</i>, <i>long sleep</i> or <i>torpidity</i> of bears,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				8, 36, 54, § 127</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>drowsiness</i>, <i>dulness</i>, <i>sluggishness</i>, <i>sloth</i> (freq., but not in Cic.), Cael. ap. <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam. 8,
				6, 4</span></i> (cited ap. <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam. 2, 13, 3</span></i>);
					<i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 8, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 1,
				124</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cat. 17, 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 7, 5,
			3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 10, 4</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">App. Flor. 3, p. 357</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
